cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Spectral Metrics of Transformer Training Are Determined by a
  Single Direction
message: If you use this software or its findings, please cite it.
type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/kaminoguo/desink
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Effective rank, RankMe, E1, CKA and anisotropy applied to
  transformer hidden states are determined by one direction
  through an exact identity. The direction is the attention
  sink. This repository contains the method, the manuscript,
  and the data behind every number in it.
keywords:
  - attention sink
  - effective rank
  - representation geometry
  - training dynamics
